00:59:43.340 --> 00:59:47.510
<v Greg Devlin>Yes, it is a bomb sitting on a bomb.
<v Greg Devlin>是的，它确实是一枚坐在炸弹上的炸弹。

00:59:47.510 --> 00:59:52.510
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
